PolicyMethodRolesConstructorTest
├── when the initial admin is zero
│   ├── it should revert.
│   └── it should carry PolicyMethodRoles_AdminInvalidAdmin of zero.
├── when the initial owner is zero
│   ├── it should revert.
│   └── it should carry OwnableInvalidOwner of zero.
├── when an initial key is the marker the hook refuses
│   ├── it should revert.
│   └── it should carry the hook error.
└── when every argument is valid
    ├── it should emit AdminTransferred from zero to the initial admin, then TrustedKeysUpdated from no keys to the initial keys.
    ├── it should make the initial owner the pause holder.
    ├── it should make the initial admin the key admin.
    ├── it should store the initial keys in order.
    ├── it should leave both pending holders at zero.
    ├── it should leave the method unpaused.
    └── it should set the name and the version.
